ecome zone or hero data. The bones ghost that appears in other players' games is a PvP-world design choice for Strategy and is not adopted by default. The donor has no corpse run, so no corpse-retrieval rule is taken from it.","decision_status":"proposed","acceptance":"A server test on a lethal hit with the save roll forced: a character with a lifesave passive and no cooldown survives once, the cooldown then blocks a second save, and a character with one life revives at full HP at a cell with zero threat while the corpse stays at the death spot and the inventory is unchanged."}
